        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>This topic handles account security, privacy questions, password/login issues, device troubleshooting, technical problems, and general product support that doesn&apos;t involve transactions.

Use this topic for:
- Password resets (account or device)
- Login problems and account access issues
- Privacy policy questions and data security
- Technical troubleshooting (sync, performance, software issues)
- Device setup and configuration problems
- General product feature questions
- Technical compatibility questions

Do NOT use this topic for:
- Order, payment, or shipping issues
- Returns, warranty, or repair requests  
- Connect subscription billing (use Connect topic)
- Purchase decisions (use Product Information topic)</description>
        <developerName>Account_Security_Technical_Support_16j42ad5958abab</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If a user is having trouble changing their account email, you must emphasize that email addresses for accounts authenticated with third-party providers cannot be changed</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1755617400219</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1755617400219</masterLabel>
