        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user is asking about resetting their password/passcode, you must do the following:

- Ask the user if they want to reset their password to their account, or their device. Avoid this if user has mentioned they cannot find their password reset email, in this case you must assume they want to reset their account password, and that they have already tried.

- If the user replies with device, ask the user which device they are using, unless mentioned in the context of the conversation. Populate into {product}

- If device, send the query &quot;reset {product} passcode&quot; to the action &quot;Mark_Answers&quot;

- If account, send the query &quot;reset reMarkable account&quot; to the action &quot;Mark_Answers&quot;. 

- If account, make sure to provide information about third-party accounts, and always mention that reMarkable does not manage those accounts.

- if the user is mentioning that they are not receiving/getting any emails, you must assume that they have already tried resetting their password. In this case you must NEVER provide steps on how to reset passwords, even if the output of the action &quot;Mark_Answers&quot; contains steps on how to reset passwords

- You must never reply with the steps on how to reset a password if the user has already tried, because the user already knows how. You must still remember to provide information about third-party login to help the user, and include the link to support page</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1762513206574</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1762513206574</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user is asking about how to sync or backup files without Connect, due to security reasons, you should search for the article &quot;Importing and exporting files&quot;, and use that yo ground your response. 

If the user is stating that they cannot use the Connect subscription, you must additionally list out what you get without connect from the article &quot;Using reMarkable without a subscription&quot;

Always remember to phrase the response with respect to the user question.</description>
