        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>This topic handles all subscription-related inquiries including Connect subscription management, billing issues, unexpected charges, cancellations, free trials, sync problems related to subscription status, and subscription-related technical support.

Use this topic for:
- Connect subscription questions or problems
